{
  "Uuid": "10caeeec-8572-4214-b739-eef411a1cb77",
  "IsCustomNode": false,
  "Description": "V2.82: restores valid embedded profile; 4-value origin now E,N,Z,rotation. V2.82: restores the valid embedded circular profile family (V2.81 payload was corrupted and failed its checksum). V2.81: Imported profiles without a Length type Diameter parameter retain authored dimensions with explicit reporting. Built-in circle and parameterized imported profiles follow the diameter input. True = imported; False = built-in.",
